OL,3,GNEWSAEx-MP to oversee Jersey's Assisted
OL,4,ADying Service
OL,5,
OL,6,FA doctor and former MP has been
OL,7,Fappointed to lead the committee
OL,8,Fsupervising the implementation of
OL,9,FJersey's Assisted Dying Service.
OL,11,FDr Sarah Wollaston spent more than two
OL,12,Fdecades working in hospital and primary
OL,13,Fcare settings, was MP for Totnes in
OL,14,FDevon from 2010-2019 and chair of the
OL,15,FUK's Health and Care Select Committee.
OL,17,FShe was among the majority of MPs who
OL,18,Fvoted against assisted dying proposals
OL,19,Fin 2015 and has expressed concerns
OL,20,Fabout normalising decisions about life
OL,21,Fand death and the affect of assisted
OL,22,Fdying on doctors.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,444,440,260,160,0,100
