OL,3,GNEWSAEx-MP to oversee Jersey's Assisted
OL,4,ADying Service
OL,5,
OL,6,FWollaston said she wanted the service
OL,7,Fto be "compassionate and lawful, with
OL,8,Fwell-trained and supported staff" with
OL,9,F"patients and their loved ones at the
OL,10,Fheart of everything".
